{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261019/photo/bkn-20261019053021201-1019_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261019062009\"/><p>藍田老翁上吊亡。今日(19日)清晨5時27分，執法部門接獲一名男途人報案，指其行經碧雲道藍田公園內，發現有人在上址的一棵樹上吊。</p><p>救援人員趕抵現場，立即將事主解下，惟經檢查後被證實死亡。人員經初步調查後，相信年約80歲的事主以一繩帶於樹上上吊，現正調查其身份，警員在現場沒有檢獲遺書，其死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T22:29:51.453413+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T21:30:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T23:37:37.763273+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T22:29:00.824371+00:00","content_hash":"814ec2ebd44cdab1796f5664423428a5f1599cf30fd59df5e9a407a32b276fbd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}